**Files changed:** `src/new_grep/new_grep.c`

**Behavior added:** Added `-h` / `--no-filename` option to force no filename prefix, opposite of `-H` / `--with-filename`.

**Last-one-wins resolution:** A single `filename_mode` variable tracks the decision: `1` for forced prefix (`-H`), `-1` for forced no-prefix (`-h`), `0` for default. Each option processed updates this value, so later options override earlier ones.

